# Third-party notices

This file lists third-party software distributed with or linked into Fruiterra
Graphics Controller. The Rust crate inventory at the end is generated by
`cargo-about` from `about.toml` and `about.hbs`; CI regenerates it and fails if
the committed copy is stale.

## Fonts

### Archivo

- Copyright 2020 The Archivo Project Authors (https://github.com/Omnibus-Type/Archivo).
- Licence: SIL Open Font License 1.1 (OFL-1.1).
- Shipped as five WOFF2 files at weights 300, 400, 500, 600 and 900 under
  `crates/server/assets/fonts/`, with `OFL-Archivo.txt` beside them.
- The active font for the HTML overlays, behind the neutral `FGC Display*`
  family aliases.

### Saira

- Copyright 2016 The Saira Project Authors (https://github.com/Omnibus-Type/Saira).
- Licence: SIL Open Font License 1.1 (OFL-1.1).
- Shipped as five WOFF2 files at weights 300, 400, 500, 600 and 900 under
  `crates/server/assets/fonts/`, with `OFL.txt` beside them.
- Retained as the fallback overlay font for the A/B comparison; the same
  `FGC Display*` aliases point at it if the trial is reverted.

### Inter

- Copyright 2016 The Inter Project Authors (https://github.com/rsms/inter).
- Licence: SIL Open Font License 1.1 (OFL-1.1).
- Shipped with the desktop UI under `crates/app/assets/fonts/`, with `OFL.txt`
  beside it.

Apotek is a commercial typeface and is **not** redistributed. The only
`Apotek` token in the product is a CSS fallback family name.

## Vendored UI components

`dioxus-primitives` is pinned from the Dioxus Components repository:

- Repository: <https://github.com/DioxusLabs/components>
